  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Pr&#xed;spevok UNFCCC 2017</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFCCC Contribution 2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Contribution of the Slovak Republic to UNFCCC, UNFCCC Kyoto Protocol and ITL Kyoto Protocol for 2017. The main aim of the convention is the protection of the environment against the negative impacts of the climate change.&#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Pr&#xed;spevok SR do UNFCCC, Kj&#xf3;tsky protokol k UNFCCC a Medzin&#xe1;rodn&#xfd; protokol transakci&#xed; ku Kj&#xf3;tskemu protokolu za rok 2017.&#xa0;Hlavn&#xfd;m zameran&#xfd;m dohovoru je ochrana &#x17e;ivotn&#xe9;ho prostredia pred negat&#xed;vnymi vplyvmi zmeny kl&#xed;my.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
